<Placemark>   <name>Vicus Ricciaco</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Village or Settlement <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 49.539563 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 6.256665<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/benelux/luxembourg/thumb/C86063F7-BB5A-48AF-AA90-7EBF395D0261.jpeg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    Ancient Village or Settlement. An important Gallo-roman settlement (vicus) between Trier and Metz. The name "Ricciaco" was inscribed in the "Peutingertafel", a copy of an ancient streetmap. In the 19t...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
